{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 10000
}


###Negative case - negative amount
POST http://localhost:55002/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Qm9nZGFuMjAwMjpCb2dkYW5pb18lMTIzNDVx

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": -50
